{"id":"haine","lemma":"haine","pos":"noun","rank":1753,"glosses":["hatred; hate"],"ipa":"/ɛn/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/5/51/Fr-haine.ogg/Fr-haine.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"haines"},"formAudio":{"haines":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/0c/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-J%C3%A9r%C3%A9my-G%C3%BCnther-Heinz_J%C3%A4hnick-haines.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"La haine a sa place.","en":"Hate has its place.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"his"},{"g":"place"}]},{"text":"Elle l'a regardé avec haine.","en":"She looked at him with hatred.","words":[{"g":"she / it"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to look at","l":"regarder"},{"g":"with"},null]},{"text":"L'amour est aveugle, la haine aussi.","en":"Love is blind. Hatred is also blind.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"love"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"blind"},{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"too, also, as well"}]},{"text":"L'indifférence est pire que la haine.","en":"Indifference is worse than hatred.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"indifference"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"worse, worst"},{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"Elle le dévisagea avec haine.","en":"She stared at him with hatred.","words":[{"g":"she / it"},{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"with"},null]}]}